<section xml:id="materials230" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Course Materials</title>

  <p>The text for this course is <url href="https://nordstrommath.com/DiscreteMathText/frontmatter.html" 
  visual="nordstrommath.com/DiscreteMathText/"><pubtitle>Discrete Mathematics, an Active Approach to Mathematical Reasoning
  </pubtitle></url> 
  by Jennifer Nordstrom. The text is a free open source text.</p>

  <p>We will also be accessing the text through <url href="https://landing.runestone.academy/" 
  visual="https://landing.runestone.academy/">Runestone Academy</url>. 
  You will need to create a free account on Runestone.
  When you register on Runestone you will need to enroll in our course: linfield_discrete_fall26.</p>
</section>